NewPipe for HarmonyOS
=====================

This project is an unofficial HarmonyOS NEXT (ArkTS / ArkUI) port of NewPipe, the
free and open-source streaming front-end for Android by Team NewPipe.

Upstream project: https://github.com/TeamNewPipe/NewPipe
Upstream website: https://newpipe.net/

It is based on NewPipe for Android 0.29.1 (build 1015), including the shared
Kotlin module (net.newpipe.app) and the download service (us.shandian.giga) that
ship in that repository.

